# Optional. With a Google AI key the assistant understands free-form requests;
# without one it understands its set phrases. Copy to .env (git ignores it).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
# The assistant's voice: a Google speech model and one of its voices. Set the
# model to "off" to use the browser's own voices.
# GEMINI_TTS_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts
# GEMINI_TTS_VOICE=Sulafat
